Write side:
- wr_bin, wr_gray (LOG_DEPTH+1 bits)
- rd_gray_sync: sync of rd_gray into wr_clk domain (SYNC_STAGES flops)
- Convert synced rd_gray back to binary to compute full
- full = (wr_gray == {~rd_gray_sync[MSB:MSB-1], rd_gray_sync[MSB-2:0]})  -- standard formula
- Or compute: wr_bin_next - rd_bin_sync == depth

